@* Roadmap UI: the forward-looking planning view over roadmap-ready entries.
   The band renders the shared library's empty state and nothing else yet, so that
   is the only namespace here — no context namespace belongs in this project.

   Every Backlog.* import is written as @@using global::Backlog.Something. This
   project's root namespace is Backlog.Modules.Roadmap.UI, and the Razor
   generator emits these directives inside that namespace without a global::
   prefix, so a bare "Backlog" would bind to Backlog.Modules the moment anything
   in this project's reference closure declares a Backlog.Modules.Backlog
   namespace. Nothing does today; global:: means nothing has to keep not doing
   it. *@
